      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">Badminton game variety: when the same four keep finding each other</h1>
      <p class="lede">Two friends playing together twice is not a clique. Four strong players quietly occupying the same corner of a thirty-player session for six months may be a different matter. The useful question is not “did anyone repeat?” but “what pattern is the club creating?”</p>
